sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant Dashboard as ODH Dashboard
    participant KServe as KServe Controller
    participant ODHModel as odh-model-controller
    participant GAIE as gateway-api-inference-ext
    participant Runtime as vllm Runtime
    participant Gateway as data-science-gateway
    participant Client as External Client

    Note over User,Client: Workflow 1: Model Deployment via Dashboard

    User->>Dashboard: Login via OAuth, select model + runtime + hardware profile
    Dashboard->>KServe: Create InferenceService CR
    KServe->>KServe: Webhook defaults spec,<br/>validates configuration
    KServe->>Runtime: Create Deployment + Service<br/>for model serving pod
    Runtime->>Runtime: Pull image from quay.io,<br/>download model from S3
    KServe->>ODHModel: InferenceService reconciliation triggers
    ODHModel->>Gateway: Create HTTPRoute for<br/>gateway routing
    ODHModel->>ODHModel: Inject platform connections,<br/>configure monitoring
    GAIE->>GAIE: InferencePool routes<br/>registered for endpoint

    Note over Client,Runtime: Production Inference Flow
    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/models/my-model:predict<br/>(HTTPS/443, TLS termination)
    Gateway->>GAIE: ext_proc selects InferencePool,<br/>applies scheduling + routing
    GAIE->>Runtime: Forward to model serving pod<br/>(KServe V2 Protocol)
    Runtime->>Runtime: Run inference
    Runtime-->>GAIE: Prediction result
    GAIE-->>Gateway: Response
    Gateway-->>Client: JSON response (HTTPS)

    User->>Dashboard: View model status + metrics
    Dashboard->>KServe: Query InferenceService status (K8s API)
    Dashboard-->>User: Show model health, replicas, latency

sequenceDiagram
    participant User as ML Engineer
    participant Dashboard as ODH Dashboard
    participant Kueue as Kueue Controller
    participant TrainOp as training-operator
    participant KubeRay as kuberay
    participant CodeFlare as codeflare-operator
    participant K8s as Kubernetes Scheduler
    participant Prom as Prometheus

    Note over User,Prom: Workflow 2: Distributed Training Job Submission

    User->>Dashboard: Submit PyTorchJob or RayJob<br/>with resource requirements
    Dashboard->>Kueue: Job CR created, webhook intercepts

    Note over Kueue: Kueue admission webhook<br/>injects scheduling gates + labels
    Kueue->>Kueue: ClusterQueue evaluates quota,<br/>checks ResourceFlavors
    alt Quota Available
        Kueue->>TrainOp: Admit workload, remove scheduling gates
        TrainOp->>TrainOp: Validate job spec (5 validating webhooks)
        TrainOp->>K8s: Create worker pods with<br/>gang scheduling (PodGroups)
        K8s->>K8s: Schedule pods respecting topology,<br/>resource flavors, gang constraints
    else RayJob Submitted
        Kueue->>KubeRay: Admit RayCluster workload
        CodeFlare->>KubeRay: AppWrapper orchestration<br/>(mutating webhook)
        KubeRay->>K8s: Create head + worker pods
    end
    K8s-->>TrainOp: Pods running
    TrainOp-->>Prom: Emit training metrics<br/>(ServiceMonitor scrape)
    User->>Dashboard: Monitor training progress

sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant Dashboard as ODH Dashboard
    participant DSPO as DS Pipelines Operator
    participant Argo as Argo Workflows
    participant MLMD as ml-metadata
    participant Registry as Model Registry
    participant KServe as KServe

    Note over User,KServe: Workflow 3: ML Pipeline Execution

    User->>Dashboard: Create or trigger pipeline run via UI
    Dashboard->>DSPO: Create PipelineRun in target namespace
    DSPO->>DSPO: Provision Argo Workflow Engine<br/>(14 CRDs via manifestival)
    DSPO->>Argo: Create Workflow CRDs
    loop Pipeline Steps
        Argo->>Argo: Execute step as pod<br/>with artifact passing
        Argo->>MLMD: Record execution metadata<br/>(gRPC-web)
    end
    Argo->>MLMD: Store final model artifacts + lineage
    MLMD->>Registry: Register model version<br/>with artifact references
    Note over Registry: Model available for serving
    Registry->>KServe: Model metadata available<br/>for InferenceService creation
    User->>Dashboard: Deploy model from registry to serving
    Dashboard->>KServe: Create InferenceService CR<br/>(triggers Workflow 1)

sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client / MaaS API
    participant Gateway as data-science-gateway
    participant GAIE as gateway-api-inference-ext
    participant Scheduler as llm-d-inference-scheduler
    participant Prefill as llm-d Prefill Instance
    participant Decode as llm-d Decode Instance

    Note over Client,Decode: Workflow 4: LLM Disaggregated Inference (llm-d)

    Client->>Gateway: Inference request via HTTPRoute<br/>(HTTPS/443, TLS termination)
    Gateway->>GAIE: EPP ext_proc callout<br/>selects InferencePool
    GAIE->>GAIE: Apply FlowControl priority bands,<br/>InferenceObjective evaluation
    GAIE->>Scheduler: Route to scheduler via ext_proc<br/>with load + latency context
    Scheduler->>Scheduler: Select prefill instance based on<br/>load, model, latency prediction
    Scheduler->>Prefill: Route prompt to prefill pod

    Note over Prefill: Process prompt tokens
    Prefill->>Decode: Transfer KV-cache state<br/>via NIXL (port 5600)
    Note over Decode: Generate output tokens<br/>using transferred KV-cache
    Decode-->>Gateway: Stream response tokens
    Gateway-->>Client: Streamed response (HTTPS)

sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as API Consumer
    participant Gateway as data-science-gateway
    participant Kuadrant as Kuadrant AuthPolicy
    participant MaaS as models-as-a-service
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API
    participant KServe as KServe
    participant GAIE as gateway-api-inference-ext
    participant Runtime as Model Runtime

    Note over Client,Runtime: Workflow 5: Models-as-a-Service API Key Flow

    Client->>Gateway: Request to /v1/models or<br/>/v1/subscriptions or /v1/api-keys<br/>(HTTPS/443)
    Gateway->>Kuadrant: AuthPolicy evaluation

    Note over Kuadrant: Multi-mechanism authentication:<br/>1. API key validation<br/>2. TokenReview against K8s API<br/>3. Optional OIDC JWT verification
    Kuadrant->>K8sAPI: TokenReview / SubjectAccessReview
    K8sAPI-->>Kuadrant: Auth result

    alt Authorized
        Kuadrant->>MaaS: Forward authenticated request
        MaaS->>MaaS: Validate bearer token via TokenReview,<br/>check admin authorization via SAR
        MaaS->>KServe: Route to model serving runtime<br/>based on MaaS subscription config
        KServe->>GAIE: InferencePool routing
        GAIE->>GAIE: Apply tenant-aware routing,<br/>priority-based flow control
        GAIE->>Runtime: Forward to model runtime
        Runtime-->>Client: Inference response (HTTPS)
    else Unauthorized
        Kuadrant-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized / 403 Forbidden
    end
